# Copy sang .env va dien gia tri that. KHONG commit .env (da gitignore).
# Chi co 4 bien chinh - moi bien giai thich rieng ben duoi.

# 1) PRIVATE_KEY - khoa vi dung de ky tx khi LIVE (7.x, CHUA lam trong repo
#    nay - hien tai KHONG co ham gui tx nao ca). Rong la binh thuong o giai
#    doan paper/dry-run. Khong bao gio dan khoa that vao chat/log/BAOCAO.
PRIVATE_KEY=

# 2) BSC_HTTP - RPC HTTP that de doc chain (eth_call/getReserves/getCode...).
#    Vi du (RPC cong khai, khong can key, chi de THU - xem README muc RPC
#    ca nhan neu chay lau dai/production):
#    BSC_HTTP=https://bsc-rpc.publicnode.com
BSC_HTTP=

# 3) BSC_WS - RPC WSS THAT, PHAI ho tro "newPendingTransactions" (khong
#    phai chi ho tro subscribe block moi) thi bot moi thay duoc giao dich
#    dang cho trong mempool. Vi du (publicnode, cong khai):
#    BSC_WS=wss://bsc-rpc.publicnode.com
#    Neu BSC_WS rong hoac node khong ho tro pending: bot tu chuyen sang
#    poll "txpool_content" qua BSC_HTTP (xem docs/RUN.md), khong dung boot.
BSC_WS=

# 4) PRIVATE_TX_URL - (tuy chon). Rong = gui qua public mempool. Chi dung khi
#    da co hop dong voi mot relay bundle that (48 Club/BlockRazor...) - xem
#    docs/STATE.md truoc khi dien.
PRIVATE_TX_URL=

# ---- Cum 5.3 (RPC pool, failover nhieu URL) — TUY CHON, KHONG bat buoc ----
# - BSC_HTTP co the la 1 URL (nhu tren) HOAC 1 chuoi NHIEU URL noi bang dau
#   phay (vd "https://a.example,https://b.example") - code tu tach.
# - Hoac dien them BSC_HTTP_2 .. BSC_HTTP_16 (moi bien 1 URL), thu theo thu tu.
# - Hoac dung BSC_HTTP_LIST=url1,url2,url3 (uu tien cao nhat neu co).
# Cung quy uoc cho BSC_WS/BSC_WS_2../BSC_WS_LIST (WSS pending-tx + heads).
# URL nao co "maxbackrun"/"fullprivacy"/"privacy" trong host se TU DONG bi
# loai khoi pool DOC (eth_call/getBlock/txpool) - do la kenh gui/private,
# khong phai dataseed doc.
# BSC_HTTP_2=
# BSC_HTTP_LIST=
# BSC_WS_2=
# BSC_WS_LIST=
